ft in policy. The allowable covered area may rise from fifty to seventy percent to align with other house types. Additionally, lifts may be installed to boost accessibility, reflecting the objective of adapting to modern living standards.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/chandigarh-housing-board-set-to-widen-scope-of-need-based-changes-for-independent-homes/134277876?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-254360/134277876.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}